  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into half-moons. Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• To a small bowl, add Greek-style yoghurt and fetta cubes and mash to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2394e7594446a7cdcbcdd/step-8a2ebe00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum and chickpeas, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce pan to medium heat, add chermoula spice blend and tomato paste, then cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, add the water and stir to combine. Lightly mash chickpeas with a potato masher or fork (add a splash of water if the mixture looks too thick). Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2394e7594446a7cdcbcdd/step-60ab8410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, toast or grill pita bread to your liking.\n• In a large bowl, combine cucumber, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2394e7594446a7cdcbcdd/step-125e6120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve pita bread and fill with hummus, chermoula chickpeas and fetta yoghurt.\n• Divide between plates with cucumber salad to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2394e7594446a7cdcbcdd/step-c586ac30.jpg"
    }
  ]
